# Test Results — hr-ai-advisory workspace

**Generated:** 2026-04-29 (Session 1 — demo readiness)
**HEAD:** 3b7ecfd + uncommitted S1 work
**Test posture:** 2357 passed, 0 failed (was 2340).

---

## Session 1 — closed 5 demo blockers (round-13 CRIT-D3, CRIT-D4, plus 3 cross-cutting)

### S1-T1 — Wire t() into NavigationSidebar (FIXED)
9 sub-nav `labelKey` values had embedded dots (`nav.payroll.runs`) which i18next read as nested namespaces, colliding with the parent string keys (`nav.payroll`) and silently falling back to English. Flattened to underscores + added 9 new keys × 4 locales. Switching locale now translates the full sidebar.

### S1-T2 + S1-T4 — Server-side feature flags + chat onboarding default (FIXED)
- `Company.feature_flags JSONB` column (added via ALTER TABLE on local; same will run on prod).
- `GET/PATCH /companies/me/feature-flags` with allow-list (`ai-scorecards`, `tafep-ai`, `chat-onboarding`), 30/min rate limit.
- `useFeatureFlag(name)` + `setFeatureFlag(name, value)` hooks in AuthContext; loaded after every auth event.
- Three localStorage toggles replaced with the new hook in recruitment/settings + settings pages.
- `(auth)/onboarding/page.tsx`: new signups (no `company_id`) → chat by default; existing companies → respect server flag.
- 14 unit tests in `test_feature_flags_router.py`.

### S1-T3 — Seed data refresh (FIXED)
`scripts/seed_demo_data.py` now PATCHes Demo Admin to `confirmed` + Management + 2021-03-01 start, sets all candidates `pdpa_consent=True` with varied source distribution, creates 5 scorecard templates, 5 preboarding tasks on the default template, and varies onboarding-assignment progress to 100/61.5/30.8/0/0.

### S1-T5 — Disconnect routing fix (FIXED)
T-R055 `/integrations/google-calendar/disconnect` was being shadowed by the generic `/integrations/{provider}/disconnect`. Fixed via two layers: structural router-registration reorder (calendar router registered before generic router) AND defence-in-depth 404 guard inside the generic handler (rejects `provider == "google-calendar"`). 3 regression tests in `test_round13_disconnect_routing.py`.

### Test-suite update
- `test_google_calendar_sync.py::test_exchange_code_persists_tokens` — now decrypts via `decrypt_field` to compare against the raw token, since H1 (Fernet at rest) is active in the env.

---

## Operational notes for prod deploy

1. `ALTER TABLE companies ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS feature_flags JSONB;` — run after `git pull`, before container rebuild.
2. `pg_dump` backup BEFORE the deploy.
3. After backend rebuild, run `python scripts/seed_demo_data.py` against prod (the script is idempotent — won't recreate users/companies that already exist; will PATCH existing rows for the demo data refresh).

